        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Reported facial and anterior neck skin symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "After the incident, reported immediate redness and tightness over cheeks, nose, forehead, and anterior neck. Small blisters developed on both upper cheeks on day 1 and ruptured spontaneously; now dry and tight with mild pain."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-7",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
