          "text": "Reported airway and respiratory symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Denies hoarseness, dysphagia, shortness of breath at the time of the incident or since, cough, and soot in the mouth."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-11",
